[{"current_page":8,"data":[{"id":283,"user_id":5,"type":"Tool","sub_type":"Static Image","title":"DALL-E 3","publisher":null,"authors":"OpenAI","featuring":null,"publish_date":"2023-11-01","link":"https:\/\/openai.com\/dall-e-3?utm_source=substack&utm_medium=email","content":"<p><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial; font-style: normal;\" data-sheets-value=\"{&quot;1&quot;:2,&quot;2&quot;:&quot;New version of OpenAI's T2I generator. In a new development, DALL-E 3 is 'designed to decline requests that ask for an image in the style of a living artist'. With this launch, OpenAI have also launched future training opt-out for artists via a form. &quot;}\" data-sheets-userformat=\"{&quot;2&quot;:1049347,&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:0},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:2,&quot;2&quot;:16777215},&quot;11&quot;:4,&quot;12&quot;:0,&quot;23&quot;:1}\">New version of OpenAI's T2I generator now interoperable with ChatGPT for easier prompting, requiring less 'engineering'. In a new development, DALL-E 3 is 'designed to decline requests that ask for an image in the style of a living artist'. With this launch, OpenAI have also launched future training opt-out for artists via a form. <\/span><\/p>","contact":null,"permission_status":null,"license":null,"example":null,"source":null,"editors":null,"image":null,"is_visible":1,"created_at":"2023-11-15T12:13:57.000000Z","updated_at":"2023-11-15T12:15:08.000000Z","pinned":0},{"id":282,"user_id":5,"type":"Tool","sub_type":"Static Image","title":"KREA","publisher":null,"authors":"KREA","featuring":null,"publish_date":"2023-10-01","link":"https:\/\/www.krea.ai\/","content":"<p><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial; font-style: normal;\" data-sheets-value=\"{&quot;1&quot;:2,&quot;2&quot;:&quot;Proprietary design suite of generative AI tools integrating 2,500 different models. There is little additional information regarding development, training or transparency, but the suite does integrate many useful features. &quot;}\" data-sheets-userformat=\"{&quot;2&quot;:771,&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:0},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:2,&quot;2&quot;:16777215},&quot;11&quot;:4,&quot;12&quot;:0}\">Proprietary design suite of generative AI tools integrating 2,500 different models. There is little additional information regarding development, training or transparency, but the suite does integrate many useful features. <\/span><\/p>","contact":null,"permission_status":null,"license":null,"example":null,"source":null,"editors":null,"image":null,"is_visible":1,"created_at":"2023-11-15T12:11:56.000000Z","updated_at":"2023-11-15T12:17:52.000000Z","pinned":0},{"id":281,"user_id":5,"type":"Tool","sub_type":"Text","title":"Chatbot Arena","publisher":null,"authors":"LMSYS Org","featuring":null,"publish_date":"2023-10-01","link":"https:\/\/chat.lmsys.org\/","content":"<p><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial; font-style: normal;\" data-sheets-value=\"{&quot;1&quot;:2,&quot;2&quot;:&quot;Chatbot Arena, a benchmark platform for large language models (LLMs) that features anonymous, randomized battles in a crowdsourced manner. Producing evaluation of LLMs seperate from their developers provides insight into their relative performance, both for Chatbot Arena's developers but also front-end users. &quot;}\" data-sheets-userformat=\"{&quot;2&quot;:769,&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:0},&quot;11&quot;:4,&quot;12&quot;:0}\">Chatbot Arena, a benchmark platform for large language models (LLMs) that features anonymous, randomized battles in a crowdsourced manner. Producing evaluation of LLMs seperate from their developers provides insight into their relative performance, both for Chatbot Arena's developers but also front-end users. <\/span><\/p>","contact":null,"permission_status":null,"license":null,"example":null,"source":null,"editors":null,"image":null,"is_visible":1,"created_at":"2023-11-15T12:11:11.000000Z","updated_at":"2023-11-15T12:11:43.000000Z","pinned":0},{"id":280,"user_id":5,"type":"Tool","sub_ty